Generic single-database configuration.


Your everyday workflow
1. Modify SQLAlchemy models
   
   Add, remove, or modify columns, relationships, indexes, constraints, etc.
2. Generate migration
   uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "describe_change"
3. Review migration
   
   Check generated SQL operations and data implications.
4. Apply migration
   uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head
5. Continue development
   
   Your PostgreSQL schema is now updated.